<div class="row">
    <div class="col">
        @if (currentGame is not null)
        {
            <GameDetails Game="currentGame"></GameDetails>
            <GameFeed Game="currentGame"></GameFeed>
        }
        else
        {
            <div id="news">

                <div id="head"></div> <h3>News</h3>

                    <img src="../images/news.jpg" alt="news" />
           
                <div>
                    <h2>Cobra goes down!</h2>
                    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Etiam quis eros ullamcorper, interdum felis vitae, fringilla sapien. Etiam et fringilla urna. Aliquam erat volutpat. Nullam hendrerit dignissim augue a imperdiet. Integer blandit neque ut rutrum luctus. Donec dignissim lacinia fermentum. Mauris leo est, rhoncus non tortor ac, dictum pulvinar lorem. Phasellus ac nibh eu sem pellentesque vulputate. Nulla vitae nisi porta, ultricies diam id, condimentum nibh.</p>
                    <p>Nunc justo quam, efficitur quis turpis vel, sodales elementum sem. Nulla a convallis elit. Cras in mollis magna, nec tempor nunc. Nunc euismod nec justo quis ultricies. Nunc dignissim orci sit amet lacus dignissim, quis venenatis neque tristique. Maecenas scelerisque lacinia nulla, ac ullamcorper purus luctus vitae. In vitae velit mauris. In quis volutpat quam. Etiam nulla ex, accumsan a placerat vitae, dictum ut enim. Praesent at justo ante. Ut scelerisque ut lacus vitae pellentesque</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        }
    </div>

    @if (games.Length > 0)
    {
        <div class="col-4" id="allGames">
            <div id="head"></div> <h3>Active Games</h3>
            @foreach (Game game in games)
            {
                <GameWidget Game="game" OnSelect="SelectGame"></GameWidget>
            }
        </div>
    }

</div>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public List<Game> Games { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public Team[] Teams { get; set; }

    private Game[] games;

    private Game currentGame;

    protected override void OnParametersSet()
    {
        games = Games.ToArray();
    }

    private void SelectGame(Game game)
    {
        currentGame = game;
    }
}
